      "type": "转发",
      "type_label": "转发",
      "text": "NVIDIA CEO Jensen Huang on Elon Musk’s AI buildout:\n\n“He’s moved from the K’s to the M’s.”\n\nNVIDIA has moved Elon’s AI business from its enterprise category into its cloud service provider category.\n\n“They’re massive.”",
